   `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/AddressNormalizer.java` (lines 47-64): trim, collapse whitespace, uppercase, expand whole words `ST→STREET`, `RD→ROAD`, `AVE→AVENUE`; null/blank → `""`.

