3. **Postcode validation** (line 178) — `validatePostcode` (lines 262-272): if blank, return (optional); else must match `^[0-9]{4}$` else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["postcode"])`; then `OwnerLocality.postcodeMatchesCity(postcode, city)` must be true else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["postcode"])` (→ 400).

4. **Map DTO → entity** (line 180) — `ownerMapper.toOwner(ownerFieldsDto)` (section 8).

5. **Telephone normalization** (line 181) — `TelephoneNormalizer.normalize(...)`.
   `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/TelephoneNormalizer.java` (lines 68-94): strip spaces/dashes/brackets; keep leading `+`/country code else assume `+61` and drop one leading `0`; must match `^\+[0-9]{8,15}$` else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["telephone"])`; fixed-length national-number check for `+61` (9 digits) and `+1` (10 digits) else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["telephone"])` (→ 400).

6. **Email normalization** (line 182) — `normalizeEmail` (lines 357-370): blank → unchanged; else must match `EMAIL_PATTERN` (line 76-77: `^[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\.[A-Za-z]{2,}$`) else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["email"])`; lowercased; domain checked against `DISPOSABLE_EMAIL_DOMAINS` (lines 86-87: `mailinator.com, tempmail.com, guerrillamail.com`) else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["email"])` (→ 400).

7. **Registration-date validation** (line 183) — `validateRegistrationDate` (lines 283-287): if non-null and after `LocalDate.now()` → `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["registrationDate"])` (→ 400).

